## Navigate to a Controlled Access File
* On GDC Data Portal V2 app
* Quick search for "1f8f88bd-812f-49b4-a125-b7f7bbe0ffe5" and go to its page

## Download Bam Slice
* Select "BAM Slicing"
* Enter "unmapped" in the text box "Genome Coordinates"
* Pause "2" seconds
* Download "File" from "Bam Slicing"
